conda-forge/smesh-feedstock recipe/patches/0004-occt-8.0-compat.patch, the netgen part: the
OCCT 8.0 pass on the netgen Partition_* files (netgen 6.2.2101).

Source: conda-forge/smesh-feedstock, `recipe/patches/0004-occt-8.0-compat.patch`, commit
c54d26ae6 ("Fix build against OCCT 8.0.0", 2026-06-23). The conda patch covers SMESH, GEOM,
NETGENPlugin and netgen together; pySMESH carries its SMESH and GEOM sections, re-ported, in
`patches/occt8/0004-occt-8.0-compat.patch`, and its NETGENPlugin sections in
`patches/netgenplugin/`. This file is its seven `src/Netgen/libsrc/occ/Partition_*`
sections, verbatim, so the paths keep the `src/Netgen` prefix of the conda layout and
`prepare.py` applies the patch at the staged top. OCCT 8.0 removed the global Handle_<Class>
typedefs and the TopTools_ListIteratorOfListOfShape.hxx and TopTools_MapIteratorOfMapOfShape
.hxx instantiation headers; the hunks use Handle() and the collection headers instead.

